  0032:  loadDigimon NiseDrimogemon
  0034:  setDigimon NiseDrimogemon 3 1
  0038:  setDigimon NiseDrimogemon 4 1
  003c:  loadDigimon Sharmamon
  003e:  setDigimon Sharmamon 5 1
  0042:  endSection
